## V. TOKENIZER â€” Critical missing component

```yaml
tokenizer_analysis:
  target_models:
    - "Qwen2.5-0.5B: uses tiktoken-based BPE (151936 vocab, cl100k-like)"
    - "Phi-3-mini:    uses llama tokenizer (32064 vocab)"
    - "Llama-nano:    uses SentencePiece BPE (32000 vocab)"

  gguf_tokenizer_data:
    location: "metadata KV trong GGUF file chinh"
    keys:
      - "tokenizer.ggml.model (string: 'gpt2' | 'llama' | 'rwkv')"
      - "tokenizer.ggml.tokens (array of strings: vocab)"
      - "tokenizer.ggml.scores (array f32: BPE scores)"
      - "tokenizer.ggml.merges (array strings: BPE merges)"
    note: "tokenizers crate co the doc GGUF tokenizer format native."

  recommended_impl:
    crate: "tokenizers = '0.19'"
    path:  "brain/master/src/tokenizer/"
    files:
      mod.rs:     "BrainTokenizer trait: encode(&str)->Vec<u32>, decode(&[u32])->String"
      gguf_tok.rs: "GgufTokenizer: load tu GGUF metadata, wrap tokenizers::Tokenizer"
    cli_commands:
      - "hace brain tokenize 'hello' -> [9707]"
      - "hace brain detokenize 9707  -> 'hello'"
```

---

## VI. ALPHA-3 INFERENCE CHAIN â€” Trang thai vs Can dat

```yaml
current_state: |
  hace brain prompt "hello"
    -> BrainMasterRuntime::execute()
    -> SioOutcome::default()         <- VOID

required_state: |
  hace brain prompt "hello"
    -> CLI -> InferRequest { prompt: "hello", model: "qwen.gguf" }
    -> BrainMasterRuntime::execute(sio)
    -> GgufLoaderStd::load("qwen.gguf")   [hacedle, reuse]
      -> GgufHeader { tensors: 291 }
      -> TensorIndex { "token_embd.weight" -> offset }
      -> ModelSpec { hidden: 896, heads: 14, layers: 24 }
    -> GgufTokenizer::encode("hello") -> [9707]
    -> EmbeddingLayer::forward([9707]) -> f32[1, 896]
    -> TransformerLayer[0..23]::forward() -> f32[1, 896]
    -> LmHead::forward()              -> f32[1, 151936]
    -> greedy: argmax(logits)         -> token_id: 1917 ("world")
    -> GgufTokenizer::decode([1917])  -> " world"
    -> print: "hello world"

wiring_needed:
  - "brain/master/src/provider/gguf/loader.rs -> hacedle::loader_std::GgufLoaderStd"
  - "brain/master/src/kernel/hacedle.rs -> hacedle::candle::CandleInferenceEngine"
  - "brain/master/src/inference/engine.rs -> kernel/hacedle + tokenizer"
  - "brain/master/src/tokenizer/ -> CREATE (tokenizers crate dep)"
  - "brain/master/src/runtime/ -> CREATE (kv_cache.rs + prefill.rs)"
```

